            "detailed_description": "Top-Down Shooter, configured for team play in completely destructible randomly generated world, consisting of several layers.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Completely destructible terrain.<br></li><li>Using a Jetpack (the ability to move between parallel levels)<br></li><li>A variety of types of weapons (pistols, submachine guns, rifles, explosives, etc.)<br></li><li>Lots of equipment combinations for building your own game tactics (Medkits, ammo, invisibility, decoys, etc.)</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Split screen mode to play with a friend online, on a remote server, from a single PC.<br></li><li>Effect of environment on the players (the change of time, weather, etc.)<br></li><li>Controller Support (XInput, Steam Controller)<br></li><li>Bot-controlled enemies practice mode.</li></ul>",
